  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A grayscale airbrush landscape of soft cliffs and clouds where a few blob animals and figures stand near spiky trees, on cream paper.",
    "description": "A square airbrush painting on cream paper, grey only. Soft rolling cloud bands fill the upper third, and below them a landscape of smoky forms: a stepped cliff or stack of ledges at left, a rounded hill with a tall spiky tree at centre, a second spiky tree at right, and ground bands with a serrated grass edge along the bottom. A four legged animal with a curled tail stands at lower left, another at lower right, a figure with a round head walks at centre bottom, and small spiky creatures climb the trees. Everything is sprayed with no outlines.",
    "impression": "The countryside for the pod people, where the trees are as spiky as the animals. The grey fog makes it feel like early morning in a valley, with the serrated grass like a row of stitches. Gentle and faintly prehistoric, a cave painting in airbrush.",
